  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1016.08 Type of Sand for Chamber and LDGP Systems",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1016.08 Type of Sand for Chamber and LDGP Systems. Chamber and LDGP systems shall be constructed using the type of sand specified in the most current version of the manufacturer’s design manual that has been approved by the department in accordance with Env-Wq 1024.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1000) #11184, eff 10-1-16; ss by #14486, eff 2-1-26, EXPIRES: 2-1-36 (formerly Env-Wq 1016.06)",
